(3480183, 485088, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oof. A family member gave another family member those as a gift once.  Not my favorite idea.... &gt;.&lt;  But, a good picture. I''d prefer a plain white background, instead of text showing through, and either a looser or tighter crop on the top and left (as it is, it just looks off now.) But I think the lighting is good and I like how you angled the can.</td>', 'Oof. A family member gave another family member those as a gift once.  Not my favorite idea.... >.<  But, a good picture. I''d prefer a plain white background, instead of text showing through, and either a looser or tighter crop on the top and left (as it is, it just looks off now.) But I think the lighting is good and I like how you angled the can.', '2007-03-22 00:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
