(3480761, 486955, 16062, '<td valign="top">Difficult lighting situation.  I would like this better without the photographer''s reflection in the cover.  Too many specular highlights too, maybe you should have turned off some lights in the room?  Also, the piece of cake that''s been cut blends in too much with the brown of the background, looks like a square piece cut from a round cake.  The whole image is not particularly sharp either.  Sorry to sound so harsh here, just my opinion!</td>', 'Difficult lighting situation.  I would like this better without the photographer''s reflection in the cover.  Too many specular highlights too, maybe you should have turned off some lights in the room?  Also, the piece of cake that''s been cut blends in too much with the brown of the background, looks like a square piece cut from a round cake.  The whole image is not particularly sharp either.  Sorry to sound so harsh here, just my opinion!', '2007-03-22 08:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
