(3485365, 485539, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very well composed, exposure is fine, framing excellent and very high technical quality. If anything DOF is slightly shallow in the foreground but not badly so. Low scores you may get for this will not because it isn''t a great photograph, it is, but because some voters will see it as being shoe-horned into the challenge.</td>', 'Very well composed, exposure is fine, framing excellent and very high technical quality. If anything DOF is slightly shallow in the foreground but not badly so. Low scores you may get for this will not because it isn''t a great photograph, it is, but because some voters will see it as being shoe-horned into the challenge.', '2007-03-24 14:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485369, 486102, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured and well composed. Some dodge and burn on the clouds would spruce it up for DPC and increase the feel of flying through ther air. This image will score well and is one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely captured and well composed. Some dodge and burn on the clouds would spruce it up for DPC and increase the feel of flying through ther air. This image will score well and is one of the best in the challenge.', '2007-03-24 14:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485400, 485682, 70514, '<td valign="top">That''s a great shot!  Very funny!</td>', 'That''s a great shot!  Very funny!', '2007-03-24 14:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485425, 484978, 61651, '<td valign="top">I think this is really nice - the focus is just right.  I wonder though if the overall composition might have been better in a portrait, rather than a landscape, orientation - just curiosity on my part - I think it looks fine as is.</td>', 'I think this is really nice - the focus is just right.  I wonder though if the overall composition might have been better in a portrait, rather than a landscape, orientation - just curiosity on my part - I think it looks fine as is.', '2007-03-24 14:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485434, 485682, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very funny application of the image to the challenge - and the slightly bored look on its face is priceless.  Nicely lit, with no really distracting background. The one downside I can see - I''m no expert by any means - but it appears the edges of the animal exhibit a "haloing" effect, which I believe is caused by too much sharpening.</td>', 'Very funny application of the image to the challenge - and the slightly bored look on its face is priceless.  Nicely lit, with no really distracting background. The one downside I can see - I''m no expert by any means - but it appears the edges of the animal exhibit a "haloing" effect, which I believe is caused by too much sharpening.', '2007-03-24 14:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485439, 486908, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like the capture of the crashing wave; the beach sand in the foreground looks very noisy to me, which is a bit of a detraction.</td>', 'I like the capture of the crashing wave; the beach sand in the foreground looks very noisy to me, which is a bit of a detraction.', '2007-03-24 15:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485446, 486149, 61651, '<td valign="top">The sky is very impressive and rightly composed to make it the star of the show in this image.  It looks like an HDR image, I may be wrong - I''m not opposed to HDR images, but I think the colors in this one are just a little too unreal for my taste.</td>', 'The sky is very impressive and rightly composed to make it the star of the show in this image.  It looks like an HDR image, I may be wrong - I''m not opposed to HDR images, but I think the colors in this one are just a little too unreal for my taste.', '2007-03-24 15:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485447, 485441, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of colors and particularly how the leaning tree joins the shrub with the house(?) facade.  The sky is distracting, though - looks like the highlights are blown.</td>', 'I like the contrast of colors and particularly how the leaning tree joins the shrub with the house(?) facade.  The sky is distracting, though - looks like the highlights are blown.', '2007-03-24 15:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485471, 485329, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally well captured image. Sharpness crisp, composition fine and DOF makes for a soft brown BG that highlights the flower and bee perfectly. Some voters may not feel this meets the challenge very well, but they will not think it is a bad picture. Kudos to you for a nice capture.</td>', 'Exceptionally well captured image. Sharpness crisp, composition fine and DOF makes for a soft brown BG that highlights the flower and bee perfectly. Some voters may not feel this meets the challenge very well, but they will not think it is a bad picture. Kudos to you for a nice capture.', '2007-03-24 15:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485481, 486091, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done BW... Good pose, excellent tones and lighting. Hope you don''t get trashed by voters very much for DNMC.</td>', 'Very nicely done BW... Good pose, excellent tones and lighting. Hope you don''t get trashed by voters very much for DNMC.', '2007-03-24 15:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485487, 484385, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good idea, perspective and general technicals are high. Dn''t know if you could have teaken this with a higher f/stop but if you could to get a little more DOF then the image might have been even better.</td>', 'Good idea, perspective and general technicals are high. Dn''t know if you could have teaken this with a higher f/stop but if you could to get a little more DOF then the image might have been even better.', '2007-03-24 15:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485490, 486929, 5792, '<td valign="top">What I like best about this image is the setting. Looks like Arizona (Sedona specifically) or southern Utah. This image has the look and feel of a magazine ad. Some voters might fault it for that. Of course, they''d be wrong. Great capture! Everything about it is good. One of the top images in this challenge.</td>', 'What I like best about this image is the setting. Looks like Arizona (Sedona specifically) or southern Utah. This image has the look and feel of a magazine ad. Some voters might fault it for that. Of course, they''d be wrong. Great capture! Everything about it is good. One of the top images in this challenge.', '2007-03-24 15:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3485491, 485410, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellent quality, well composed. Super job. Wonder what this would look like in BW.</td>', 'Excellent quality, well composed. Super job. Wonder what this would look like in BW.', '2007-03-24 15:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
