(3495946, 486359, 60862, '<td valign="top">Welcome to Team Suck! :)<br/> <br/>I like the setup and the colors, and the blurred background.  The highlights are distracting.   Sunlight''s always going to be tough on a curved metal surface, so maybe you could try shading it next time - even with your body if necessary.<br/> <br/>My only other comment is I''d crop out almost all of it to the right of the fly.  Maybe make the right edge line up with the end of the title?  That''d pull the fly out of the center, which would be better.  Right now, the right third of the shot is dead space.</td>', 'Welcome to Team Suck! :) I like the setup and the colors, and the blurred background.  The highlights are distracting.   Sunlight''s always going to be tough on a curved metal surface, so maybe you could try shading it next time - even with your body if necessary. My only other comment is I''d crop out almost all of it to the right of the fly.  Maybe make the right edge line up with the end of the title?  That''d pull the fly out of the center, which would be better.  Right now, the right third of the shot is dead space.', '2007-03-29 02:06:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3495949, 486899, 60862, '<td valign="top">Heh.  Thought I recognized you, Svetlana.  And the cast clinched it.  Not sure how this fits the challenge, honestly, but it''s another interesting shot from you. :)</td>', 'Heh.  Thought I recognized you, Svetlana.  And the cast clinched it.  Not sure how this fits the challenge, honestly, but it''s another interesting shot from you. :)', '2007-03-29 02:09:24.000000', NULL, 0),
