(3496860, 486359, 34113, '<td valign="top">Nice little wooly bugger and the peacock herl sparkles. This is nice and crisp, but the fly should be the dominant part of the image instead of the vise so maybe have only the barb/point held by the vise which will separate the fly from the distracting metal. Also, keep the shank of the hook parallel with the top and bottom frames and crop a little tighter to let potential tyers really focus on the fly materials and structure.</td>', 'Nice little wooly bugger and the peacock herl sparkles. This is nice and crisp, but the fly should be the dominant part of the image instead of the vise so maybe have only the barb/point held by the vise which will separate the fly from the distracting metal. Also, keep the shank of the hook parallel with the top and bottom frames and crop a little tighter to let potential tyers really focus on the fly materials and structure.', '2007-03-29 13:48:55.000000', NULL, 0),
