(3497689, 486955, 56243, '<td valign="top">wow, this one got hit pretty bad.  sorry to see that.  I just wanted to share something i have found to fix the harsh flash spot when shooting reflective materials.  It''s called a LumiQuest Soft Screen.  I love it and it really helps a lot.  It''s also not expensive at all and they make it for all styles of cameras.  Hope it helps.</td>', 'wow, this one got hit pretty bad.  sorry to see that.  I just wanted to share something i have found to fix the harsh flash spot when shooting reflective materials.  It''s called a LumiQuest Soft Screen.  I love it and it really helps a lot.  It''s also not expensive at all and they make it for all styles of cameras.  Hope it helps.', '2007-03-29 18:01:30.000000', NULL, 0),
