(5676961, 486744, 70828, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by langdon:</b></div><hr/><i> Everyone is giving me flowers!  I would much prefer something that won''t die in a few days. ;)  Cool shot, though I think something needs to be done about the lighting to make the shot more dramatic... the lighting is almost too uniform. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Erm ... btw ... I never said this before ... but! ... This orchid PLANT had never an intention to die in a few days ... It has survived in situ at my mother-in-law''s house for about 6 years, I think ... <br/> <br/>me</td>', 'Originally posted by langdon: Everyone is giving me flowers!  I would much prefer something that won''t die in a few days. ;)  Cool shot, though I think something needs to be done about the lighting to make the shot more dramatic... the lighting is almost too uniform.   Erm ... btw ... I never said this before ... but! ... This orchid PLANT had never an intention to die in a few days ... It has survived in situ at my mother-in-law''s house for about 6 years, I think ...  me', '2009-10-06 14:55:47.000000', NULL, 0),
